{"id":"n55084-1-9","stage":5,"title":"면회 · 会面","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n55084-1-9-1","ko":"오늘 조카 보러 간다며?","zh":"今天不是说要去看侄子吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}},{"text":"조카","meaning":"侄子、侄女、外甥、外甥女","explanation":"조카：侄子、侄女、外甥、外甥女。","readings":[{"term":"조카","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91753","senseId":"1","lemma":"조카","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조카","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3"}},{"text":"보러","meaning":"见，碰头","explanation":"보다：见，碰头；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"5","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보러","audio":"/audio/d5e8ae6946132d84eb67.mp3"}},{"text":"간다며?","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；ㄴ다며：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"간다며","audio":"/audio/5d792482175938d5390d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"f468453f8bc9c337","term":"조카","zh":"侄子、侄女、外甥、外甥女","audio":"/audio/f468453f8bc9c337dd97.mp3","entryId":"91753","definition":"兄弟姐妹生的孩子。","pronunciation":["조카"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"见，碰头","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"以某种目的而见人。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가